{
  "$doc": "DESIGN_X2_Order_Reresolution.md \u00a78 (X2-H, R-8361): PlatoonDefend gives orders through CommandOrders.Route and re-sends only when Stands fails; the routed checks are resolution-blind and match by RequestId, which the reconciler keeps (IsResume).",
  "runFor": 40,
